OL,7,FAndy Burnham tells MPs new EU-UK deals
OL,8,Fcould boost growth and tackle illegal
OL,9,Fimmigration
OL,11,FHe says a summit next month will
OL,12,Fdiscuss "a trade deal on food and drink
OL,13,Fproducts", energy and "deeper
OL,14,Fco-operation on immigration"
OL,16,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch says
OL,17,Fthe PM is "not going to get a better
OL,18,Fdeal" as the EU "are tough negotiators"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
