OL,3,ABurnham tells MPs new EU deals could
OL,4,Aboost growth and help tackle illegal
OL,5,Aimmigration
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, Burnham told a podcast it
OL,8,Fwas "clear" Russia had interfered in
OL,9,Fthe Brexit vote. Badenoch and Lib Dem
OL,10,Fleader Ed Davey called on Burnham to
OL,11,Fshare the evidence, while Reform leader
OL,12,FNigel Farage branded the PM "a liar"
OL,14,FThe PM also says it is "highly likely"
OL,15,Fthat Iran was behind the incident at
OL,16,FRAF Fairford, saying it was "almost
OL,17,Fcertainly directed by Iran's Islamic
OL,18,FRevolutionary Guard"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
